# agentic-OS User Request Flow - Mermaid Diagrams

## Complete Request Lifecycle

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph INPUT["USER INPUT LAYER"]
        CLI["CLI: python agentic-os.py --goal 'Build REST API'"]
        API["API: POST /execute"]
        CHAT["Interactive Chat Mode"]
    end

    INPUT --> PARSE

    subgraph PARSE["PHASE 1: REQUEST PARSING"]
        P1["Parse goal, constraints, context"]
        P2["Create request_id (UUID)"]
        P3["Set iteration = 0"]
        P1 --> P2 --> P3
    end

    PARSE --> LOOP

    subgraph LOOP["RECURSIVE LOOP (1 to MAX_ITERATIONS)"]
        direction LR
        
        subgraph RECOLLECT["PHASE 2: RECOLLECT"]
            R1["Load from SQLite<br/>forge_state, failures, history"]
            R2["Load from Memory<br/>SESSION-STATE.md, MEMORY.md"]
            R3["Load from Git<br/>Last commit, branch state"]
            R1 & R2 & R3 --> R4["Combine context"]
        end

        subgraph THINK["PHASE 3: THINK"]
            T1["RAG Retrieval<br/>Query memory with TF-IDF"]
            T2["Meta-Cognition Analysis<br/>Analyze failure patterns"]
            T3["Derive constraints<br/>For each error type"]
            T4["Build Disciplined Prompt<br/>RAG context + constraints + 'No Quitting'"]
            T1 --> T2 --> T3 --> T4
        end

        subgraph GENERATE["PHASE 4: GENERATE (GAN)"]
            G1["Generator creates code"]
            G1 --> D1["Discriminator evaluates"]
            D1 --> S1{"Score >= 0.7?"}
            S1 -->|"No"| G2["Refine code"]
            G2 --> G1
            S1 -->|"Yes"| G3["PASSED"]
        end

        subgraph VERIFY["PHASE 5: VERIFY"]
            V1["Docker Sandbox execution"]
            V2["Syntax check"]
            V3["Unit tests"]
            V1 & V2 & V3 --> V4{"SUCCESS?"}
            V4 -->|"No"| FAIL["Record failure<br/>increment iteration<br/>loop again"]
            V4 -->|"Yes"| PASS["PASSED"]
        end

        FAIL -.-> RECOLLECT
    end

    RECOLLECT --> THINK
    THINK --> GENERATE
    GENERATE --> VERIFY

    VERIFY --> VALIDATION

    subgraph VALIDATION["PHASE 6: USER VALIDATION"]
        V5["Present code to user"]
        V5 --> DECISION{"User Decision"}
        DECISION -->|"[ACCEPT]"| SUCCESS["END: SUCCESS"]
        DECISION -->|"[REFINE]"| FEEDBACK["Add user feedback<br/>Loop again"]
        DECISION -->|"[REJECT]"| REJECTED["END: REJECTED"]
        FEEDBACK -.-> THINK
    end

    SUCCESS --> FINALIZE

    subgraph FINALIZE["PHASE 7: FINALIZE"]
        F1["Save to SQLite"]
        F2["Update Memory (WAL)"]
        F3["Git commit (atomic)"]
        F4["Send alerts"]
        F1 --> F2 --> F3 --> F4
    end
```

## Validation & Termination Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    START["User Submits Request"] --> LOOP_START
    LOOP_START["Loop Start<br/>iteration = 1"] --> RECOLLECT

    subgraph RECOLLECT["RECOLLECT"]
        R1["Load SQLite state"]
        R2["Load memory"]
        R1 --> R3["Combine context"]
        R2 --> R3
    end

    RECOLLECT --> THINK
    subgraph THINK["THINK"]
        T1["RAG retrieval"]
        T2["Meta-cognition analysis"]
        T3["Build prompt"]
        T1 --> T2 --> T3
    end

    THINK --> GENERATE
    subgraph GENERATE["GENERATE"]
        G1["GAN loop"]
        G1 --> G2{"Quality OK?"}
        G2 -->|"No"| G1
        G2 -->|"Yes"| G3["Code ready"]
    end

    GENERATE --> VERIFY
    subgraph VERIFY["VERIFY"]
        V1["Sandbox execution"]
        V1 --> V2{"Success?"}
        V2 -->|"No"| FAIL_RECORD["Record failure"]
        FAIL_RECORD --> INCREMENT["iteration++"]
        INCREMENT --> CHECK_MAX
        V2 -->|"Yes"| USER_VAL["Present to user"]
    end

    CHECK_MAX{"iter >= MAX?"}
    CHECK_MAX -->|"Yes"| MAX_REACHED["END: MAX_ITERATIONS"]
    CHECK_MAX -->|"No"| RECOLLECT

    USER_VAL --> USER_DECISION
    USER_DECISION{"User accepts?"}
    USER_DECISION -->|"Yes"| SUCCESS_END["END: SUCCESS"]
    USER_DECISION -->|"Refine"| FEEDBACK_LOOP["Add feedback<br/>Loop again"]
    USER_DECISION -->|"Reject"| REJECT_END["END: REJECTED"]

    FEEDBACK_LOOP --> THINK
```

## GAN Self-Correction Loop

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    START["Goal Input"] --> GEN
    
    subgraph GEN["Generator"]
        G1["Create code from prompt"]
        G2["Return code + constraints"]
    end
    
    G1 --> CODE
    
    subgraph DISC["Discriminator"]
        D1["Check error handling"]
        D2["Check type hints"]
        D3["Check documentation"]
        D4["Check code length"]
        D1 & D2 & D3 & D4 --> SCORE["Calculate score"]
    end
    
    CODE["Generated Code"] --> DISC
    SCORE --> QUALITY{"Score >= 0.7?"}
    
    QUALITY -->|"No"| ISSUES["List issues"]
    ISSUES --> REFINE["Refine code"]
    REFINE --> GEN
    
    QUALITY -->|"Yes"| PASS["Code passes<br/>quality threshold"]
```

## User Validation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant AgenticOS
    participant Memory
    participant Git
    
    User->>AgenticOS: Submit goal: "Build REST API"
    AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: Parse request
    AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: Loop iteration 1
    
    loop Recursive Loop
        AgenticOS->>Memory: RAG retrieval
        Memory-->>AgenticOS: Relevant memories
        AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: Meta-cognition analysis
        AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: GAN generate code
        AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: Verify in sandbox
    end
    
    AgenticOS->>User: Present generated code
    User->>AgenticOS: [ACCEPT] / [REFINE] / [REJECT]
    
    alt User accepts
        AgenticOS->>Git: Final commit
        AgenticOS->>Memory: Update wisdom
        AgenticOS->>User: Success + artifacts
    else User refines
        AgenticOS->>AgenticOS: Loop with feedback
    else User rejects
        AgenticOS->>User: Rejected message
    end
```

## State Persistence Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph PERSIST["PHASE: PERSIST (On Success)"]
        PS1["Save to SQLite"]
        PS2["forge_state table"]
        PS3["forge_history table"]
        PS4["Update SESSION-STATE.md (WAL)"]
        PS5["Distill to MEMORY.md if lessons found"]
        PS6["Git atomic commit"]
        PS7["Create prod branch"]
    end

    subgraph RECOVER["RECOVERY (On Restart)"]
        RR1["Load state_snapshot.json"]
        RR2["Compute environment hash"]
        RR3{"Hash matches?"}
        RR4["Resume from checkpoint"]
        RR5["Warm start complete"]
    end

    subgraph FAILURE_RECORD["On Failure"]
        FR1["Log to failures table"]
        FR2["Update state_snapshot.json"]
        FR3["Increment recursion_depth"]
        FR4["Return to RECOLLECT"]
    end
```

## Termination Conditions

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    START["Process Running"] --> CHECK

    CHECK{"Which condition met?"}
    
    CHECK -->|"User clicks [ACCEPT]"| T1["SUCCESS"]
    CHECK -->|"User clicks [REJECT]"| T2["REJECTED"]
    CHECK -->|"iteration >= MAX"| T3["MAX_ITERATIONS"]
    CHECK -->|"LLM unavailable"| T4["HIBERNATED"]
    CHECK -->|"User timeout 30min"| T5["PAUSED"]

    T1 --> FINAL1["Record acceptance<br/>Final commit<br/>Send alert<br/>Return SUCCESS"]
    T2 --> FINAL2["Record rejection<br/>Clean state<br/>Return REJECTED"]
    T3 --> FINAL3["Save best effort<br/>Send alert<br/>Return MAX_ITERATIONS"]
    T4 --> FINAL4["Serialize state<br/>Wait for LLM<br/>Return HIBERNATED"]
    T5 --> FINAL5["Preserve state<br/>Generate resume token<br/>Return PAUSED"]
```

## Memory Flow (WAL Protocol)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph WRITE["Write Path (WAL)"]
        W1["Tool call executes"] --> W2["Write SESSION-STATE.md"]
        W2 --> W3["Append to daily log"]
        W3 --> W4["Every 100 iters:<br/>Distill to MEMORY.md"]
    end

    subgraph READ["Read Path"]
        R1["Query arrives"] --> R2["Search SESSION-STATE.md"]
        R2 --> R3["Search daily logs"]
        R3 --> R4["Search MEMORY.md"]
        R4 --> R5["TF-IDF ranking"]
        R5 --> R6["Return Top-K"]
    end
```

